From 54e69e46662ff7e0828992274b2de39e6cd9fb12 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sovereignos <sovereignos@localhost>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 06:13:02 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] sovereignos: add the Duress Unlock main and set-up screens
 and the Device unlock row

Adds the row below Duress password (order 1010, system user only), the
main screen, the set-up and change screen, the Android adapter of the
flow, the strings and the manifest entries. Both activities finish at
once for any user but the system user, so a decoy session cannot open
them. A candidate PIN is checked against the wipe PIN through
isDuressWipeCredential and never through checkCredential.
